RecitationAnalysis "1" *-- "0..*" RecitationError : identifies
ErrorType "1" -- "0..*" RecitationError : categorizes
RecitationError "1" *-- "0..*" ErrorFeedback : receives
RecitationError "0..1" -- "0..*" AudioAssistance : triggers
